- Configs & secrets per environment, stored in secret manager.

10. Database migration rules
- Migrations must be reviewed in PR.
- Use additive changes when possible; breaking changes require migration plan and downtime window.
- Keep rollback plan and backup snapshot before applying in prod.

11. Monitoring & Alerting
- Logs: centralized Serilog sink (ELK/Seq/Datadog).
- Health checks endpoint `/health` and metrics exporter for Prometheus.
- Alerts: DB down, high error rate, failed jobs, payment webhook failures.
- On alert: follow runbook -> assign on-call -> escalate to Team Lead.

12. Incident management
- Triage: Severity P1/P2/P3; P1 = production outage.
- Communication: use Slack/MS Teams channel + incident doc.
- Post-mortem: timeline, root cause, mitigation, action items.

13. Scheduled jobs & EDI
- `Depot.ApiIntegration` runs scheduled polling, EDI sends/receives messages.
- Jobs must be idempotent and have retry/backoff and dead-letter for poison messages.

14. Payments & Webhooks
- Webhook endpoint must validate signatures and idempotency keys.
- On payment failure, create ticket and notify Billing team.

15. Security & Compliance
- No secrets in code. Use Key Vault / pipeline secret store.
- Run static code analysis and dependency vulnerability scan.
- Periodic access review for production credentials.

16. Operational runbooks (short)
- Recover service: check logs -> restart service -> run smoke tests.
- DB restore: follow backup & restore guide (stored in `0. Solution Items/runbooks`).
- File storage issue: check `Storage-File` logs and disk space; failover to alternative provider if configured.

17. Onboarding checklist for new developer
- Clone repo, open solution.
- Setup local DB and env vars from `.env.sample`.
- Run `dotnet ef database update` and seed data.
- Start `Depot.BackendApi` and run unit tests.
- Read architecture docs in `0. Solution Items` and join team channels.

18. Documentation & templates
- Keep `PR_TEMPLATE.md`, `ISSUE_TEMPLATE.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md` in `0. Solution Items`.
- Publish OpenAPI spec artifact in CI for frontend integration.

